,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: Translation-furigana,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Karaoke-furigana,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: Default-furigana,Arial,10,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1,1,2,10,10,10,1Style: Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextComment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,SubsComment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,AttacksComment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Credits,,0,0,0,,CreditsComment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,OpeningDialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:25.71,Main,,0,0,0,,We, the pirates from Whitebeard's Second Division, will save Commander Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:26.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:28.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop this!Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:33.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you all doing this for me?!Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:38.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm your little brother!Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.55,0:00:44.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You're so stupid, Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:46.43,Main,,0,0,0,,You too, Old Man!Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.43,0:00:49.59,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Become my son!Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.94,0:01:06.33,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:10.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.45,0:01:15.65,Main,,0,0,0,,... ready to accept whatever the future has in store for me.Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.50,0:01:19.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take the outstretched hand that saves me...Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:24.40,Main,,0,0,0,,... or bow to the blade that punishes me.Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.95,0:01:31.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.39,0:01:33.74,Main,,0,0,0,,... not going to fight it anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.46,0:01:40.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, everyone.Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.47,0:04:19.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Resume the attack!Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:20.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:34.86,Title,,0,0,530,,The Prisoners of Impel DownDialogue: 0,0:04:35.11,0:04:39.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Right away, he's the center of attention!Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.37,0:04:41.59,Main,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:45.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy!  We can't let him outshine us!Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:48.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's take Whitebeard's head already!Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.73,0:04:51.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Very well, my friends!  Let's do this!Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.81,0:04:58.23,Main,,0,0,0,,But still, what's up with this crazy battlefield?Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.23,0:05:01.41,Main,,0,0,0,,The marines and pirates here are all world-renowned!Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:04.31,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be better if I just lay low here...Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.31,0:05:06.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Red-Nose!Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Who're you callin' Red-Nose, you bastard?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:11.77,Main,,0,0,0,,You wanna die or somethin'?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.06,0:05:18.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.53,0:05:20.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd seen you somewhere before...Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:23.70,Main,,0,0,0,,You're that brat who was on Roger's ship, aren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.97,0:05:27.57,Main,,0,0,0,,That sure takes me back... So you're still alive?Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:31.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!  He's spotted me.  I'm gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.11,0:05:34.55,Main,,0,0,0,,We're done for!  We have no choice but to run!Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.55,0:05:38.18,Main,,0,0,0,,W-Whitebeard!  The great Whitebeard...Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.18,0:05:40.54,Main,,0,0,0,,talked to the Captain!  Amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:43.76,Main,,0,0,0,,You really are a legendary pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.43,0:05:46.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't act so impressed!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.95,0:05:49.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll catch the same hell as me!Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:52.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Judging from all the prisoners you've brought along...Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.27,0:05:56.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I suppose you've come to take my head?Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.30,0:06:00.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure!  Long time no see, huh?  Now prepare yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.67,0:06:06.54,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a limit to how far you can take this!Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:13.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Really, now?  I don't mind if you wanna take my head, but what're you gonna do afterward?Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:17.52,Main,,0,0,0,,The Navy's forces are far too big for you to handle.Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:21.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, they're a bit much for me too.  I've got my hands full here.Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:27.00,Main,,0,0,0,,So, you wanna join up with me, and we'll take out the Navy as fellow pirates?Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:30.47,Main,,0,0,0,,You can take my head after that.Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.47,0:06:36.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second!  How much respect does Whitebeard have for you?Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.51,0:06:38.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It's like they're equals!Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.08,0:06:41.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think he'd refer to his equal as a brat...Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.35,0:06:45.55,Main,,0,0,0,,It's reckless of you to try and fight the Navy!  Do you really think we can win?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:49.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, if I get serious, yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:53.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to his common sense?Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:54.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously?Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.76,0:06:56.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I'm getting goosebumps!Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:58.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to feel like I can do this!Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.40,0:06:59.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I can do it!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.15,0:07:02.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I can see it now!  Buggy, king of the world!Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:08.54,Main,,0,0,0,,If the two of us join forces, we can crush the Navy.Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:13.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, stop it!  You're so cool!  Too cool!Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.13,0:07:15.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, Whitebeard! We'll back you up!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.97,0:07:18.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I will back you up!Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:20.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is he?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:23.72,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! He's our Captain Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:27.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how simple-minded these guys are.Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:33.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Disregarding Red-Nose, the others behind him are pretty strong.Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.25,0:07:35.60,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be a pain to have to fight them.Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.03,0:07:41.59,Main,,0,0,0,,So, now...Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.18,0:07:51.75,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Whitebeard.Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:53.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Is Squard there?Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:56.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Old Man!  Captain Squard is...Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:08:00.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?  He was here a minute ago...Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:01.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems we've lost sight of him.Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.55,0:08:07.74,Main,,0,0,0,,He got carried away trying to impress you, Old Man...Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:12.26,Main,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.  Then, DeCalvan Brothers!Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:14.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it, Old Man?Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.36,0:08:15.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Old Man, what should we do?Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:20.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Take command of all the pirate crews, and pass my orders on to them!Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.51,0:08:26.56,Main,,0,0,0,,What?  The Old Man?  Alright, then I'll start on the right.Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.95,0:08:29.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll take the left.Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.33,0:08:31.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure.  Got it.Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.55,0:08:34.18,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll go to the right.Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.18,0:08:36.73,Main,,0,0,0,,If that's what the Old Man wants...Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.06,0:08:40.20,Main,,0,0,0,,My ship will go anywhere you want it to.Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:44.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Squard?  I don't see him anywhere... Is that right?Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:48.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go to the left.Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.02,0:08:54.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral Sengoku!  The New World pirates are changing their attack pattern!Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.52,0:08:57.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they've scattered off in every direction.Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.73,0:09:00.79,Main,,0,0,0,,They've started attacking the warships!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:19.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Well played, Whitebeard!  He saw it coming.Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:22.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems he's not falling for such an obvious trick.Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.74,0:09:24.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I suppose I was too crude.Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:29.95,Main,,0,0,0,,But sharp intuition won't be enough to stop fate!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:38.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.  Moriah's up against "Knight of the Sea", Jinbe?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:41.43,Main,,0,0,0,,The Seven Warlords of the Sea are a vital part of our defense!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.43,0:09:43.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What good is it if they just kill each other?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.64,0:09:48.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm more than a match for you, Moriah!Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:51.33,Main,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight me, Jinbe?Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.11,0:09:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Very well!  I can't use my Zombie Warriors with you around, after all!Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.04,0:10:00.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep moving, Luffy-kun!  Don't waste any more time!Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.95,0:10:02.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:04.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Our shadows are acting strange.Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.18,0:10:13.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Marine shadows, give me your strength!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.47,0:10:32.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Now then, I'll be taking your shadow!Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.99,0:10:39.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll spend eternity in the gloom at the bottom of the sea, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.49,0:10:44.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Hand over your shadow!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:22.68,Main,,0,0,0,,All that work and your shadows have left you...Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:24.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have enough skill.Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:28.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Now step aside, Moriah.Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:30.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry.Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:33.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, dammit!  The battle isn't over!Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.15,0:11:47.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.73,0:11:52.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way, Tashigi!Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.47,0:12:01.67,Main,,0,0,0,,That hurt!  You're...Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.67,0:12:02.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Smokie!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.47,0:12:08.03,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!  His jutte has seastone inside of it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you...Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:15.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I will finish you!Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:27.66,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a lot stronger than before!Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.66,0:12:29.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.01,0:12:32.16,Main,,0,0,0,,He disappeared!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:34.30,Main,,0,0,0,,He's fast!  Where'd he go?Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.07,0:12:52.18,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems we've both grown stronger since we last met.Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.02,0:13:04.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't defeat me with your ability.Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:07.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's that... jutte...Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.87,0:13:10.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I finally understand...Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.41,0:13:14.50,Main,,0,0,0,,... why Dragon saved you...Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:17.44,Main,,0,0,0,,.... back in Loguetown.  Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:23.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Dragon got in my way back then, but this time, you're not getting away!Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:25.65,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Damn it...Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.65,0:13:27.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Get your filthy hands off him!Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:32.19,Main,,0,0,0,,She managed to hit me, even though I'm smoke...Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.21,0:13:35.39,Main,,0,0,0,,But kicks shouldn't touch him...Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.30,0:13:38.17,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:41.30,Main,,0,0,0,,The Pirate Empress protected Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:44.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Hancock!  What are you playing at?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.29,0:13:46.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you intend to quit being a Warlord, too?Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:47.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Silence!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.85,0:13:50.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I am so infuriated, I don't care what you say!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.69,0:13:55.48,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you beat and hold down my dearest?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.39,0:13:59.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I will not let you live!Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.51,0:14:02.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I have never been this angry before!Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:06.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I will rip you apart and feed you to a beast!Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:09.43,Main,,0,0,0,,So that was the Haki of the Kuja Tribe...Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.74,0:14:13.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Hancock!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.37,0:14:15.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:18.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You called me "Hancock" again!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.61,0:14:23.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Kuma! Kuma, come to vyour senses!Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.57,0:14:27.99,Main,,0,0,0,,It's vme! Have vyou forgotten vmy face?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.99,0:14:30.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Come to vyour senses, or Vi will fight back!Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.23,0:14:31.95,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a limit to how much Vi can take!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.16,0:14:36.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what sort of history you two have,Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:37.56,Main,,0,0,0,,but just give it up.Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.76,0:14:42.83,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no point in talking to him, Emporio Ivankov, Commander of the Revolutionary Army.Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:44.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou're...Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.13,0:14:46.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What are vyou saying?!  What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:51.77,Main,,0,0,0,,The man you know was probably named Bartholomew Kuma, right?Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.77,0:14:56.71,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're thinking of the man once called Kuma the Tyrant...Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.31,0:14:59.74,Main,,0,0,0,,... he's long dead.Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.05,0:15:03.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What are vyou talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:10.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Kuma...Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:12.60,Main,,0,0,0,,... is dead?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:24.10,Main,,0,0,0,,W-What's going on? Why did the Pirate Empress protect Straw Hat?Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.41,0:15:31.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this.Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the key to your brother's handcuffs.Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:46.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy's hand... Luffy's hand...Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:47.86,Main,,0,0,0,,... touched mine!Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:50.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Hancock!Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:55.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the best! You're the best!Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:16:01.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!  I owe you one!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.97,0:16:05.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I-It's alright!  It's alright!Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.06,0:16:06.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Do not worry about it, just...Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:08.98,Main,,0,0,0,,... just keep moving forward, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:10.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:12.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:23.52,Main,,0,0,0,,No way! The Pirate Empress was defeated?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.52,0:16:27.77,Main,,0,0,0,,He crushed her attack!  He must have countered it with Sumo wrestling!Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:31.95,Main,,0,0,0,,So this is what I heard so much about...Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.06,0:16:34.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Marriage!Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:57.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Insolent one!  I shall not let you past me!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:17:01.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at that!  It's her Extreme Looking-Down Pose!Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.05,0:17:03.93,Main,,0,0,0,,She's looking so far down her nose, she looks up instead!Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.93,0:17:09.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what'll happen if you get in the Navy's way?Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:13.28,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter what I do, I shall be forgiven...Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:17.25,Main,,0,0,0,,... for I am beautiful!Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.25,0:17:20.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm really grateful for this! I owe her another one!Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.59,0:17:24.12,Main,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?! Kuma is dead?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.12,0:17:27.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Then who's the man standing in front of vme?Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:30.71,Main,,0,0,0,,He's clearly alive!  Don't be ridiculous!Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.93,0:17:33.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Iva-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.23,0:17:36.77,Main,,0,0,0,,It's that guy that looks like a bear!Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.23,0:17:36.77,Note,,0,0,0,,Kuma: BearDialogue: 0,0:17:45.60,0:17:48.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Iva-chan, do you know him?Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.39,0:17:51.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah... But he's acting strange.Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.73,0:17:59.03,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems like the two of you have memories of Kuma,Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:01.29,Main,,0,0,0,,but the Kuma you know, and this guy,Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:04.23,Main,,0,0,0,,are two different people!Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.87,0:18:07.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Different people?  What's he talking about?Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:12.96,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not possible!  This is, without a doubt, the man who ate the Paw-Paw Fruit.Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.96,0:18:15.91,Main,,0,0,0,,He's definitely Kuma! Speak to vme, Kuma!Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.58,0:18:22.97,Main,,0,0,0,,It's useless, just like I've been saying. It doesn't matter how much you try to talk to him.Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.97,0:18:25.32,Main,,0,0,0,,The other day,Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.57,0:18:31.81,Main,,0,0,0,,... the Government's head scientist, Doctor Vegapunk, completed his final modifications on him...Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.81,0:18:36.63,Main,,0,0,0,,... and transformed him into a perfect human weapon.Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.63,0:18:41.47,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, this isn't Bartholomew Kuma anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:45.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Modifications? A weapon? What are vyou talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.83,0:18:47.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Basically, he was selected...Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.33,0:18:54.05,Main,,0,0,0,,... by the Government's human weapon project to be a test subject.  He volunteered for it himself.Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.10,0:18:56.61,Main,,0,0,0,,They started with his arms...Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:18:58.65,Main,,0,0,0,,... then his legs...Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.65,0:19:01.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Leaving his consciousness intact,Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.02,0:19:06.27,Main,,0,0,0,,the scientists replaced his body parts piece by piece, over a long period of time.Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.53,0:19:12.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop lying!  Kuma hates the World Government!Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.13,0:19:15.17,Main,,0,0,0,,He would never...Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:18.44,Main,,0,0,0,,... offer his own life to the Government!Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:25.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know what kind of deal this guy had with the Government.Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:32.88,Main,,0,0,0,,A couple of days ago, there was definitely some human left in him.Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.99,0:19:42.04,Main,,0,0,0,,But now, he's lost all memory of being born human.  He's as good as dead.Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:45.83,Main,,0,0,0,,He's become a monster who only fights according to the Government's orders.Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.34,0:19:50.30,Main,,0,0,0,,The Pacifista, PX-0!Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.30,0:19:53.20,Main,,0,0,0,,The past is gone, you should just forget it!Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.29,0:20:11.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Kuma! What happened to vyour body these past few years?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.99,0:20:15.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it...Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.79,0:20:19.05,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We will never meet again.Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:21.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Farewell.Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.25,0:20:24.34,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the last thing he said to me...Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.34,0:20:27.56,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kuma? It's vme!  Ivankov!Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,W-Where is he? Where did he go?Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.95,0:20:37.75,Main,,0,0,0,,He's dangerous, you guys!  Be careful!Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:56.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn vyou, Kuma!Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.93,0:21:08.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou scared yet?Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.39,0:21:40.68,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare vyou attack vmy adorable Candies?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:44.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't think Vi will hold back any longer!Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.25,0:21:46.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:56.37,Main,,0,0,0,,He sure is strong!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.28,0:21:59.71,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the first time anyone Vi have met has...Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.43,0:22:04.80,Main,,0,0,0,,...forgotten...Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.80,0:22:10.57,Main,,0,0,0,,... forgotten vmy face! That has never happened to vme before!Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.22,0:22:13.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh... Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:14.65,Main,,0,0,0,,However!Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.28,0:22:18.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Vi don't know if it's because vyour memories are gone,Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.32,0:22:21.96,Main,,0,0,0,,but if vyou have even forgotten how terrifying Vi can be...Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.96,0:22:24.62,Main,,0,0,0,,... then Vi will just beat the fear back into vyour body!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.34,0:22:27.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.30,0:22:31.56,Main,,0,0,0,,He sure recovered quickly...Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.56,0:22:33.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Vi will take care of him.Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.31,0:22:37.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou all, go help Straw-Hat-boy!Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.58,0:22:38.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger that!Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.84,0:22:41.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.55,0:22:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help, Iva-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:47.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Head for the execution platform!Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.18,0:22:51.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.99,0:22:55.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn that cheeky Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.79,0:22:57.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get too far ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.24,0:23:02.14,Main,,0,0,0,,It's time to put Operation: "Make Captain Buggy Famous" into action!Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.14,0:23:03.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.39,0:23:06.92,Main,,0,0,0,,If we succeed, the entire world will be forced to acknowledge my awesomeness!Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.92,0:23:10.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't fall behind, and carry out my plan!Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.56,0:23:18.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Will this plan really work?Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.07,0:23:25.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.83,0:23:27.57,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no end to them!Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.39,0:23:33.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I was thrown pretty far from him...Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.17,0:23:37.09,Main,,0,0,0,,We're not letting you get anywhere near the Old Man!Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.09,0:23:38.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get...Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.20,0:23:41.45,Main,,0,0,0,,... in my way!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.19,0:23:48.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What a troublesome fellow... He just won't give up.Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.05,0:24:06.82,Main,,0,0,0,,He's so big and fast...Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.82,0:24:08.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Here he comes again.Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.43,0:24:11.50,Main,,0,0,0,,The Commander of the Third Division, Diamond Jozu.Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.23,0:24:26.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you got out, Croc-man.Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.73,0:24:29.65,Main,,0,0,0,,How was your bath in the pond of blood?Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.65,0:24:35.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo.  Don't interfere.  You wanna die?Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.79,0:24:38.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What an unpleasant thing to say...Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.29,0:24:41.46,Main,,0,0,0,,How 'bout it?  Wanna team up with me?Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.26,0:24:45.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You think you're getting past?Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.20,0:24:47.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Think you can stop us?Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.20,0:24:48.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Go, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.60,0:24:51.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.30,0:25:07.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Red Hair...Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.68,0:25:12.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I will not go easy on him.Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.73,0:25:16.19,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...!Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.21,0:25:21.13,Main,,0,0,0,,... Hawk Eye!Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.60,0:25:29.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Now then, fate.Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.45,0:25:35.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Will the life of a promised child from the next generation... end here?Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.51,0:25:40.43,Main,,0,0,0,,If not, how will he escape from this Black Blade?Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:27.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.88,Main,,0,0,0,,... Balloon!Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:49.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate...Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:55.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Sharkskin Palm Block!Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.63,0:11:05.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Shark Brick True Fist!Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.30,0:12:11.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear Second!Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.51,0:12:17.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.51,0:12:21.99,Main,,0,0,0,,... Jet Gatling!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,White Launcher!Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.00,0:16:38.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Perfume Femur!Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:41.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Pad CannonDialogue: 0,0:20:59.14,0:21:00.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Face...Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:02.40,Main,,0,0,0,,... Spectrum!Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.05,0:21:14.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Galaxy Wink!Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.13,0:23:51.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Brilliant Punk!Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:15.88,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing SewilDialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:27.79,Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:02:16.35,0:02:21.22,Credits,,0,0,0,,QC Galaxy 9000 PepperjackDialogue: 0,0:02:27.86,0:02:31.66,Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.46,0:02:35.10,Credits,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking HaleeDialogue: 0,0:02:37.97,0:02:41.21,Credits,,0,0,0,,Translation YibisDialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:45.98,Credits,,0,0,0,,Raws CruchyrollDialogue: 1,0:02:10.16,0:02:10.99,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 1,0:02:10.16,0:02:10.99,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,雨Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.16,0:02:10.99,Kanji-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,あDialogue: 1,0:02:10.16,0:02:11.09,Kanji-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,めDialogue: 1,0:02:10.23,0:02:11.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 1,0:02:10.23,0:02:11.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:02:10.23,0:02:11.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.23,0:02:11.29,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,上Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.23,0:02:11.29,Kanji-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,あDialogue: 1,0:02:10.29,0:02:15.43,Translation,,0,0,0,fx,EDialogue: 1,0:02:10.29,0:02:15.46,Translation,,0,0,0,fx,vDialogue: 1,0:02:10.33,0:02:11.29,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:02:10.33,0:02:11.66,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,がDialogue: 1,0:02:10.33,0:02:15.46,Translation,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:02:10.33,0:02:15.46,Translation,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:02:10.36,0:02:15.46,Translation,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 1,0:02:10.36,0:02:15.50,Translation,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.39,0:02:15.50,Translation,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 1,0:02:10.39,0:02:11.66,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 1,0:02:10.39,0:02:11.66,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:02:10.39,0:02:11.93,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,りDialogue: 1,0:02:10.39,0:02:15.50,Translation,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:02:10.39,0:02:15.53,Translation,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 1,0:02:10.43,0:02:15.53,Translation,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:02:10.43,0:02:15.53,Translation,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.46,0:02:15.53,Translation,,0,0,0,fx,IDialogue: 1,0:02:10.46,0:02:15.56,Translation,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.49,0:02:11.93,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:02:10.49,0:02:11.93,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:02:10.49,0:02:11.93,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.49,0:02:12.26,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,のDialogue: 1,0:02:10.49,0:02:15.56,Translation,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 1,0:02:10.49,0:02:15.56,Translation,,0,